# RexDB is an orphan branch: it holds the database and nothing else.
#
# A working tree that also has Rexarr checked out leaves the whole application sitting here untracked when the
# branch is switched, and one `git add -A` would commit the app - and data/, which holds settings.json and an
# API key - into the database. These keep that from happening.
client/
server/
shared/
distribution/
docker/
docs/
logo/
overrides/
site/
data/
node_modules/
.idea/
.vscode/
test-media/
release/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
.env
